Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord1.9\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\fad(734,941)\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\t(4279,4321,\1a&HFF&)}Hiriluk's Cherry Blossoms
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,941)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Hiriluk's Cherry Blossoms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, how you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:02:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you completely recovered\Nfrom your illness already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure am. I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we go say\Ngoodbye to the old doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.01,0:02:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lady and that Dalton guy from the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.93,0:02:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to leave Chopper alone with Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lived with her for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should let them say goodbye in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.35,0:02:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's going to be\Nreally sad for them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E acts all tough in front of us, but deep\Ndown, I think she really is a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're just going to leave\Nwithout saying anything to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once Chopper comes back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll go straight down the\Nmountain and set sail to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to you, right, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, now that we have a\Ndoctor coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'll go\Nahead and get the ropeway ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know there was a ropeway!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems as if we have a\Ncouple of patients missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, they all left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Directly disobeying your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, where have you been all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can help the men\Ntake the cannons outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please listen, Doctorine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving with the others right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming on board with\Nthem as the ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to travel everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.49,0:03:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this foolishness, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, you know\Nyou're my only assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who taught you\Neverything you know about medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really feel no gratitude\Nat all for what I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, that isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm incredibly grateful to you, Doctorine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll always love this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's where I met you\Nand Doctor, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you can find\Nanother home as nice as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in the outside\Nworld, you're sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates aren't good\Nfor anything, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll end up dead on some\Nvagabond sword in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sound so sure of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reindeer going out to sea—that's the\Nmost ridiculous thing I've ever heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am a reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I'm a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can talk tough for now, but\Nyou're still my assistant, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave, you're going\Nto have to go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Alto...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:05:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still afraid of your own shadow,\Nand you're telling me you're a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eam, these pirates, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're staying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what all that noise is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on, we'd better\Nhurry and get all this stuff outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we aren't careful, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo will start using\Nus for target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't exaggerate. Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away from me, chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of noise\Ncoming from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and consider it, making all that noise\Nwhen those two are trying to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just downright rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E, but I want to go out and see\Nthe world beyond this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why could someone like you\Ndo on a pirate ship, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to try to live\Nsome fantasy like that old quack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor's research was finally\Ncompleted before he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, finally, here he comes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being chased!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got the ropeway ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on the sleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to head down the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the witch's sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correa's reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then those pirates were\Nriding in the sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Wapol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Dalton's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey reindeer, can we do that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot, we don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna\Ndie. Hey, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Sanji, you're awake. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think that was\Nthe best way to say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pet I was taking care of is being\Nlooked after by someone else now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't like long goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:09:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! We have work to do. We have to\Nprepare a fitting send-off. It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally done it. This is it.\NThis reaction I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 years for this Doctor It wasn't\Na fantasy like she said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finished your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You accomplished your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But was that all a lie, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My research is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.53,0:09:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you lie because you knew how sad I'd\Nbe if you died without completing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is impossible for a\Nman who raises a pirate flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say it again, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, young man, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dust is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep! Sleep! Sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corgi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just chat up and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Waffle setting off\Nfireworks or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, those are cannon blasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch for cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dark to see what\Nthey're doing up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corgi, all the cannons have been fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then light them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After 30 years, this just finally\Ncompletes my research. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is just absolutely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't understand\Nwhat that idiot was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make cherry blossoms\Nbloom in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once my invention is perfected,\Nthis country is as good as saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you crazy quack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary red dust, Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dust is designed\Nto attach itself to the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,white snowflakes as they\Ncome down from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The white snow will then become a beautiful\Nshade of pink for everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor Eve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:12:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I'm not\Ngoing to shoot you, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Hiriluk, Dr. Hiriluk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony, Tony Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's what I'm going to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to become a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I should disappear right\Nnow, my dream will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had a marvelous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, have a safe trip, my stupid son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these cherry blossoms\Nare like party decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper, step out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just sit there and\Ndaze all night long, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come sing a song with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.55,0:13:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, shove these chopsticks\Nup your nose. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a great moonlit night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms are in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did we not party?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to tell you, but your new\Nfriends are about as crazy as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys can really be a lot to handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.99,0:13:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that you're one of us, you're\Ngoing to have to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conney, what in the world were you\Ndoing frozen in the river like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.41,0:13:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird, Ten Berries, says he\Nslipped and fell into the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a clumsy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Mr. Bushido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that the guy named Zoro was\Nswimming in the river and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thought Zoro was in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:14:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he jumped into the river to help\Nand ended up getting frozen in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were really able to understand\Neverything Kari was saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still technically half-animal by\Nnature, so I can understand what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can talk to animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between your medical skills and talking to\Nanimals, you've got some amazing talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk-flattering me like that isn't\Ngoing to make me happy or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you mean about\NChopper's medical skills anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Chopper here is a doctor\Nand a first-rate one at that. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha taught him everything\Nthere is to know about medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, are you seriously a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cool. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Luffy, if you didn't know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what did you think Chopper was\Nwhen you asked him to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A talking transforming reindeer monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backup food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in such a big hurry, I\Nleft my medical bag behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had all of my tools in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.26,0:14:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:14:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in the back of the sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one who packed the\Nsleigh and got it ready for the trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing. Doctor, must have\Nknown what you were planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do even before you had decided\Nto leave the island with us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a kind
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys you're having a\Nsentimental moment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Straw Hat Crew! Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've never had this much fun ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I propose a toast to\Nour new friend, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've made\Nit off the island yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:17:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that reindeer friend of yours is a\Nfirst-rate doctor with a first-rate heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very glad to have known him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cherry blossoms of Hera looks\Nreally did lead to something miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who'd have thought the\Nmiracle would be that clumsy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reindeer going out to sea\Nwith a group of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid, acting like he's\Na grown man all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I'll\Nmake a fine ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are your plans now that Wapol\Nhas gone from the island for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a long time, I worked as the captain\Nof the guard under Waple's tyrannical rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something that I still\Nneed to make amends for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about leaving this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trusting the citizens\Nto make a better land
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for themselves without\Nme here as a reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you've decided to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize that leaving here isn't\Nthe way to make up for past mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country is rid of\Nits corrupt monarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its citizens are preparing to build\Na new country that's all their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think if I stayed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could find a way to help them build it\Ninto the country that it's meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that will help,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by washing away some of the guilt that\NI've carried around with me for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems to me that you\Ncertainly do possess the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strength of heart to take\Ncare of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strength of heart is needed\Nto look after a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it can be difficult to come by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I once sought from a girl who was\Nno more than ten years old at the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.61,0:18:30.44,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(720,760)\fscx90\fscy90\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.8\fad(975,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H25&\t(0,975,\1a&H00&)\3c&H11161B&}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
Dialogue: 2,0:18:26.61,0:18:30.44,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(720,760)\fscx90\fscy90\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFEFCFA&\fad(975,0)\4a&HFF&}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
Dialogue: 3,0:18:26.61,0:18:30.44,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(720,760)\fscx90\fscy90\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFEFCFA&\fad(975,0)\4a&HFF&}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the world's summit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a useless event this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of coming to\Nthis thing every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much longer Drum\NKingdom can continue like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rift between the monarchy\Nand the citizens keeps growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the king of Alabasta!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(476,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(0,476,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&}{Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of the Kingdom of Arabasta-OG}Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of Arabasta{PJ}
Dialogue: 2,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,0)\4a&HFF&}{Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of the Kingdom of Arabasta-OG}Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of Arabasta{PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,0)\4a&HFF&}{Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of the Kingdom of Arabasta-OG}Nefertari Cobra\NRuler of Arabasta{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cobra Nefertari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A king who is known throughout the\Nworld for his benevolence and wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:18:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The revolutionist dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man's beliefs are very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As world leaders, we should be aware of\Nthe threat he poses to our countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In as little as five or six years,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he will likely become a prominent\Nenemy opposed to our interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know about the\Nrest of your dumb countries,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but mine's governed too well for my citizens\Nto be led astray by some revolutionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and capture him if\Nyou want, but leave me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a selfish fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we've all\Ngathered here at the World Summit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just act responsibly for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one talks to me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that summit was as\Nunenjoyable as all the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's that idiot cobra's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand must have slipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Viby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, you're the\Nprincess of Alabasta Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:19:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must suck to have\Nsuch a pathetic father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop. You gotta um, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't look where I was going sir
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is quite a child
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At a world summit like\Nthis where all the most
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful leaders are\Ngathered tensions tend to run
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,high the slightest\NArgument can trigger an all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-out war knowing that she\Nrefused to make a scene
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so young to be so wise
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an annoying little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.03,0:20:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made me so proud today, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That princess had great\Nstrength of heart indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's remained strong all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would make anyone proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:20:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The desire to care for our country\Nhasn't faded from within us either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to help build a new country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country will be reborn\Nas you always wished it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like your son, Chopper. Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something\Nimportant that I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Straw Hat\Npirate who defeated Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sure of it You mean he has a\N30 million berry bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you certain goodness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're quite a band\Nof rogues, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I completely forgot\Nto report this to you Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.61,0:21:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it all happened about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man who seemed to be a random traveler\Nshowed up one day over in Robeltown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strangely, it was a day\Nwithout any snowfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no idea where\Non the island he landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he told us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man said he was\Nhunting down Blackbeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pirate who recently attacked\Nour island with his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, once he realized that\NBlackbeard had already left,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.67,0:22:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said, In that case, I\Nhave one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.25,0:22:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has a pirate wearing a Straw Hat\Ncome through this area recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't know, so he showed us\Nthe wanted poster and said...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if the guy I\Ndescribed does show up...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.65,0:22:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deliver this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.13,0:22:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will wait for him in Alabasta\Nfor ten days and no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell us your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Ace, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tell the Straw Hat\Npirate, then he'll know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.43,0:23:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, catch that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.89,0:23:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate and didn't pay his\Ncab at the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give him the message!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.43,0:23:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he'll be waiting in\NAlabasta for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.11,0:23:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Doctor, but\Nis there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look puzzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the man Gold D.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold D.?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.41,0:23:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what he goes by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.63,0:23:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guy Chopper left this island and headed\Nout to Sea Whiff is no ordinary pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.07,0:23:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spirit of D.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It still lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.57,0:23:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.97,0:23:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is Alabasta then?\NIt's the country where Vivi's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.33,0:23:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,father rules yeah except\Nthere's this guy named Crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:24:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's trying to take over the\Ncountry right now and Crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.23,0:24:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is one of the seven Warlords\Nof the Sea who are those guys
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.67,0:24:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're pirates who are\Ngiven authority by the World
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.67,0:24:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Government the Government actually\Nsupports pirates yeah pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.31,0:24:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weird huh and the seven\NWarlords are incredibly powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, they go around defeating\Nother pirates one by one and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.13,0:24:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why the Government\Nsupports the Warlords the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.53,0:24:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to have the pirates get rid\Nof all the other pirates I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.97,0:24:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really looking forward to meeting\Nthis Crocodile guy Crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is considered a hero back\Nhome he helps get rid of the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.79,0:24:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates who attack Alabasta\Nhowever his good deeds only
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.15,0:24:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appear good on the surface he\Nis an evil man in truth he's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.75,0:24:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manipulating the citizens of\NAlabasta to bring about his civil
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,war so he can take over the\Ncountry no one has realized what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.95,0:24:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crocodiles doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.13,0:24:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.33,0:24:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even my father. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.51,0:24:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is beat\Nup that crocodile guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.21,0:24:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but in order to do that,\Nwe have to avert the Civil
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War in Alabasta and get Baroque\Nworks out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.95,0:25:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baroque works?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.13,0:25:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.43,0:25:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.43,0:25:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't understand\Nwhat's going on with them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a really complicated system\Nof agents, bosses, and partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system is actually
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.24,0:25:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, at the very top of the\Norganization is the boss, Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,known as Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a total of\N12 agents in one animal
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.75,0:25:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who receive orders from the boss directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.03,0:25:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the most part, these 12 male\Nagents operate as part of a pair with
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a female agent. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.57,0:25:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is paired with Miss Doublefinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.27,0:25:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.18,0:25:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two doesn't actually have
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.73,0:25:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a female partner. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three is the Candleman we\Nmet in Little Garden, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.39,0:25:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.30,0:25:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his partner is the\Npainter, Miss Goldenwink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.69,0:25:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.85,0:25:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.43,0:25:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.34,0:25:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four is next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's paired up with Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.13,0:25:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know much more than\Nthat about those two, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.59,0:25:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's that snot\Nguy. Mr. Five. Snot?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, his snot is explosive. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five's entire body is a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.09,0:26:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His partner, Miss Valentine,\Nhas the kilo kilo fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.47,0:26:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the woman who can change\Nher weight whenever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.43,0:26:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The agents with code names from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.47,0:26:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One through Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five are known as officer agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.17,0:26:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They each possess one of\Nthe Devil Fruit powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.19,0:26:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they are only sent on\Nthe most important missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agents Mr. Six through Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.57,0:26:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirteen have the job of fundraising.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.51,0:26:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make money for the\Norganization by heading
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.45,0:26:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up the employees at the\Nentrance to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.21,0:26:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about that weird monkey\Nand chicken pair I ran into?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.81,0:26:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.72,0:26:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirteen and Miss Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.57,0:26:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the agency's punishment squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.83,0:26:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They punish any agent who\Nfails to complete a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.81,0:26:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there are more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under the officer agents\Nare 200 men called billions,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there are another 1,800 men under the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.91,0:26:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,frontier agents that\Nare known as millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.01,0:26:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together they make up the secret\Ncrime syndicate Baroque Works.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.33,0:26:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, 200 plus\N1,800 equals, um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 2,000 of them? 2,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.43,0:26:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.39,0:27:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are we going to get to\NAlabasta so I can beat up Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't think you\Nget it at all, Loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Baroque Works' sole objective\Nis to take over Alabasta,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.41,0:27:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can guess what that must mean—the\Nrest of the officer agents as Phoebe called
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.39,0:27:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them and their subordinates are probably\Non their way to Alabasta as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.97,0:27:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.01,0:27:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.92,0:27:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in that case we just go beat up that's\Nenough floofy just let it go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.64,0:27:28.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,700)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(483,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(0,483,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&}Little Garden,\NThe Island of Giants
Dialogue: 2,0:27:25.64,0:27:28.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,700)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(483,0)\4a&HFF&}Little Garden,\NThe Island of Giants
Dialogue: 3,0:27:25.64,0:27:28.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,700)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(483,0)\4a&HFF&}Little Garden,\NThe Island of Giants
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.91,0:27:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr. Toot. Mr. Bon Clay, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.61,0:27:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you idiots quit playing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you completely clueless?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.73,0:27:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Bon Clay, a Baroque\Nworks officer agent.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:42.08,0:27:47.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,530)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(476,476)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(0,476,\1a&H00&)\t(4814,5272,\1a&HFF&)\3c&H000000&}{Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N(Officer Agent)\NBaroque Works-OG}Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N{\fs85\bord4.2}Officer Agent, Baroque Works{PJ}
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.08,0:27:47.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,530)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,476)\4a&HFF&}{Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N(Officer Agent)\NBaroque Works-OG}Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N{\fs85}Officer Agent, Baroque Works{PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:27:42.08,0:27:47.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,530)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,476)\4a&HFF&}{Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N(Officer Agent)\NBaroque Works-OG}Mr. 2 Bon Kurei\N{\fs85}Officer Agent, Baroque Works{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.13,0:27:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I strike fear into the\Nheart of anyone who sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.91,0:27:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, navigator, tell\Nme something. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that little pea-brain of yours\Nremember what the boss's exact orders were?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.51,0:27:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The orders were to kill Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:28:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three on his way along the direct route\Nbetween Little Garden and Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.25,0:28:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.39,0:28:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not entirely\Nuseless, now are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.23,0:28:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a direct route means that\Nyou travel in a straight line,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.37,0:28:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't it, Navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we went straight from Alabasta\Nto Little Garden, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.41,0:28:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then something seems to have gone wrong\Nwith the plan, now hasn't it, Navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We reach Little Guard\Nwithout so much as seeing Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three while on our way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.57,0:28:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to me, that seems to indicate\Nthat you fools missed Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.99,0:28:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three's ship entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.41,0:28:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir, that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.19,0:28:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it sort of sounds like you're\Nquestioning my intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.47,0:28:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.63,0:28:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.97,0:28:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is kill\Nthe pathetic Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be an easy mission and one\Nat which we have no excuse to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.35,0:28:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must complete the mission soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't, then Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.67,0:28:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and his partner will be sent\Nout to make sure I end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.67,0:28:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear enough for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.67,0:28:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't want to answer to\Nme, then you'd better get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for that Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.11,0:29:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want this ship going as\Nfast as it can, you imbeciles!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.05,0:29:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading to Alabasta immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.07,0:29:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, Mr. Two, Mr. Bonclay, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.47,0:29:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.69,0:29:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are attacking\Ntowns inside the kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they know this country\Nis protected by crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.25,0:29:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can tell what they're thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.73,0:29:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A country where riots are constantly\Nbrewing may be considered an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.39,0:29:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do have a public duty to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.33,0:29:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very kind of you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.97,0:29:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a kind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.81,0:29:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We warlords are charged with protecting\Nthe public from pirate threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.25,0:29:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are heroes to these people after all.

